  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mustard seeds, cumin seeds, turmeric, and paprika, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the paneer cubes and cook until they are lightly browned.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Use your hands to shape the paneer mixture into small nigiri-shaped balls.",
    "Serve the Juicy Snappy Algerian Paneer Tagine hot.",
    "Garnish with fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Store any leftovers in an airtight container in the refrigerator."
  ],
